WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.638
Welcome to Clarity Checker.

00:00:01.638 --> 00:00:10.073
This is a pre-launch walkthrough: the
production ingredient and evidence library
is empty, and OCR is not enabled in the
current app image.

00:00:10.073 --> 00:00:13.653
This video explains the workflow, not live
product results.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:20.117
Create an account with a unique password of
at least twelve characters, verify your
email, then sign in.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:22.632
The optional profile is for your own notes.

00:00:22.632 --> 00:00:26.317
It is not a diagnosis and is not sent to
explanation providers.

00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:32.350
Choose a clear J P E G, P N G, or WebP label
photo up to ten megabytes.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:40.312
In this build, type ingredients manually,
one per line, and compare every spelling
with the package.

00:00:40.312 --> 00:00:43.496
Never confirm text you have not checked.

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:46.745
Save a draft if you want to return later.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:52.902
To analyze, confirm the non-empty list you
reviewed, then select Analyze confirmed
list.

00:00:52.902 --> 00:00:57.240
Matching is exact; unknown or ambiguous
names stay unresolved.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.619
No finding is not proof of safety.

00:00:59.999 --> 00:01:02.104
Explanations are optional.

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:09.552
OpenAI and Groq need separate consent and
can explain one finding, but never change
results.

00:01:09.552 --> 00:01:12.790
History lets you reopen or delete scans.

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:17.891
Settings offers export, account deletion,
and consent controls.

00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:22.100
This is educational information, not medical
advice.
